{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/extras/1_ATD.png?t=1743955207\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Demo features the very first chapter of <i>Justice For Sale</i>.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not all detectives wear fedoras and trench coats. You'll be playing as Vin Virosa, a street-borne private eye with a foul mouth and a dark past. Your clients are Katherine and Chloe, two ambitious police officers looking to prove themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/extras/2.png?t=1743955207\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique investigation mechanisms: Bribery &amp; Intimidation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stuck on something? Need a hint? In <i>Justice For Sale</i>, you don't get that by asking nicely. Bribe suspects with money, or even shove a gun in their face to discover the truth. Not the noblest act, but hey. What\u2019s the worst that could happen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/extras/3_EN.png?t=1743955207\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first chapter of <i>Justice For Sale</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bribe suspects or intimidate them into spilling their secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short answer questions. A real detective wouldn\u2019t just guess, right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich jazz soundtrack. Really makes you feel like an actual genius.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557660?t=1743955207","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/b3693c76f309bfa1d5a36c7c7e9231629bf31a90/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743955207","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/c7d98fa217b340a1dfd7bc1c3fba479cd6490798/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743955207","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/c7d98fa217b340a1dfd7bc1c3fba479cd6490798/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743955207","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Justice For Sale is a noir-style detective game that contains depictions of crime, corpses murder investigations, and suicide. \r\nIncludes: \r\n- scenes of violence\r\n- character deaths\r\n- presence of blood/corpses\r\n- strong language\r\n- mild sexual references"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/extras/1_ATD.png?t=1743955207\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Demo features the very first chapter of <i>Justice For Sale</i>.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not all detectives wear fedoras and trench coats. You'll be playing as Vin Virosa, a street-borne private eye with a foul mouth and a dark past. Your clients are Katherine and Chloe, two ambitious police officers looking to prove themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/extras/2.png?t=1743955207\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique investigation mechanisms: Bribery &amp; Intimidation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stuck on something? Need a hint? In <i>Justice For Sale</i>, you don't get that by asking nicely. Bribe suspects with money, or even shove a gun in their face to discover the truth. Not the noblest act, but hey. What\u2019s the worst that could happen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/extras/3_EN.png?t=1743955207\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first chapter of <i>Justice For Sale</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bribe suspects or intimidate them into spilling their secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short answer questions. A real detective wouldn\u2019t just guess, right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich jazz soundtrack. Really makes you feel like an actual genius.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Slater Chae"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3523520","name":"Man of Nollyn"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557660/f57560e6e172e997ec44405c7e0129398dc5a5dd/header.jpg?t=1743955207","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257107784,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107784/movie480.mp4?t=1741710742","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107784/movie_max.mp4?t=1741710742"},"name":"Short Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257107784/daf7f072b811f2bc15390648ea634e88d19936f8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741710742","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107784/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741710742","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107784/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741710742"}}],"name":"Man of Nollyn Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</stron